# ngp: prevent turning off by accident

- Source URL: https://github.com/jotego/jtcores/issues/1232

## Issue Title
ngp: prevent turning off by accident

## Issue Description
In the ngp and ngpc cores, we can simulate turning off the console by pressing the coin button. This is necessary, for example, if you want to change the game you're playing without going through the console setup menu again.

A user has requested a way to disable this button. Since it is of common use in other games, it is easy to click by accident, especially in Pocket handheld mode, making you lose progress midgame.

Putting this button behind a menu option should not be the solution, since it is fundamental to the console's operation.

Another possibility is adding an option so that "turning off" becomes a button combination, instead of the coin button by itself.

